          "distinct": true,
          "id": "543d945983b94cff694583716e2a026c2cc919a9",
          "message": "fix(core): serialize predicate statistics in a stable order (#6440)\n\n* fix(core): serialize predicate statistics in canonical order\n\nSort the shared predicate-statistics writer by predicate ID so an external build and a reopened re-save emit identical bytes. Preserve the existing format and unordered-file reader. Add an exact-byte regression across map capacities, insertion orders, and reloads.\n\nCo-Authored-By: GPT-6 <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* docs: declare reviewed predstats wasm source-location drift\n\nRecord the source-bound same-host artifacts, exact differing bytes, diff-mapped panic locations, and independently reviewed disassembled callsites. Separate this manual evidence from the uninspected CI binary observation, without changing either artifact-equality or size gates.\n\nCo-Authored-By: GPT-6 <noreply@openai.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: GPT-6 <noreply@openai.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-09-07T02:56:47Z",
